{"availability":"available","full":"Olayiwola72/raft-consensus-visualizer","name":"raft-consensus-visualizer","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":21,"forks":2,"created":"2026-04-01T13:29:29Z","updated":"2026-04-22T11:03:44Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://raft-consensus-visualizer.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:27.428Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:27.428Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:27.428Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:27.428Z","stars":21,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A polished system design visualizer for understanding how the Raft consensus algorithm works.","This project focuses on clarity over infrastructure. It uses a deterministic in-browser simulation with no database so developers can study leader election, quorum, heartbeats, log replication, and failure recovery through an interactive UI.","Raft can feel abstract when it is described only in text. This project turns the algorithm into a visual system design tool so you can inspect cluster behavior tick by tick, introduce failures, and watch recovery play out in a way that is easier to reason about."],"features":["a deterministic in-browser simulation","a professional front-end interface","strongly typed state transitions","a clean separation between simulation engine and view layer"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Olayiwola72/raft-consensus-visualizer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"12f6bdfc3378943af9b1944f2c21cd9f772dad3794841e77901048adcf8f8433","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:27.522Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:07:27.522Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A polished system design visualizer for understanding how the Raft consensus algorithm works.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Olayiwola72/raft-consensus-visualizer/blob/main/README